# AI2AI Quick Assessment

Pattern: **Standalone** — facts, computation, and prose all in one file. No external imports. Self-contained analysis that can be shared as a single document.

## Source Data

```scheme
;; pltg Core Facts
(load-document "memo" "../source/series_a_memo.txt")

(fact arr 2800000
  :evidence (evidence "memo"
    :quotes ("Annual Recurring Revenue (ARR): $2,800,000")
    :explanation "Current ARR"))
