(print "Facts loaded:")
arr
```

AI2AI: $[[fact:arr]] ARR, [[fact:enterprise-customers]] enterprise customers, [[fact:total-customers]] total. Raising $[[fact:round-size]] at $[[fact:pre-money]] pre-money.

## Key Metrics

```scheme
;; pltg Computed Metrics
(derive gross-margin (/ (- revenue cogs) revenue) :using (revenue cogs))
(derive ltv-to-cac (/ ltv cac) :using (ltv cac))
(derive runway-months (/ cash monthly-burn) :using (cash monthly-burn))
(derive post-raise-cash (+ cash round-size) :using (cash round-size))
(derive post-raise-runway (/ post-raise-cash monthly-burn) :using (post-raise-cash monthly-burn))
(derive arr-multiple (/ pre-money arr) :using (pre-money arr))
(derive dau-wau-ratio (/ dau wau) :using (dau wau))
(print "Gross margin:")
gross-margin
```

- Gross margin: **[[term:gross-margin]]%**
- LTV/CAC: **[[term:ltv-to-cac]]x**
- NRR: **[[fact:nrr]]%**
- Runway: [[term:runway-months]] months pre-raise → **[[term:post-raise-runway]] months post-raise**
- Valuation: **[[term:arr-multiple]]x ARR**
- DAU/WAU: **[[term:dau-wau-ratio]]**

## Validation

```scheme
;; pltg Business Rules
(axiom margin-ok (> ?m 0.6) :origin "gross margin > 60%")
(derive margin-check margin-ok :bind ((?m gross-margin)) :using (gross-margin margin-ok))

(axiom ltv-cac-ok (> ?r 3.0) :origin "LTV/CAC > 3x")
(derive ltv-cac-check ltv-cac-ok :bind ((?r ltv-to-cac)) :using (ltv-to-cac ltv-cac-ok))

(axiom retention-ok (> ?n 130) :origin "NRR > 130%")
(derive retention-check retention-ok :bind ((?n nrr)) :using (nrr retention-ok))

(axiom churn-ok (< ?c 2.0) :origin "monthly churn < 2%")
(derive churn-check churn-ok :bind ((?c monthly-churn-pct)) :using (monthly-churn-pct churn-ok))

(axiom valuation-ok (< ?v 25) :origin "ARR multiple < 25x")
(derive valuation-check valuation-ok :bind ((?v arr-multiple)) :using (arr-multiple valuation-ok))
(print "All checks:")
valuation-check
```

All checks: margin[[~term:margin-check]], LTV/CAC[[~term:ltv-cac-check]], retention[[~term:retention-check]], churn[[~term:churn-check]], valuation[[~term:valuation-check]].

## Verdict

Strong deal. [[term:ltv-to-cac]]x LTV/CAC with [[fact:nrr]]% NRR at [[term:arr-multiple]]x ARR is compelling for Series A. [[term:post-raise-runway]] months of post-raise runway provides ample time to reach $10M. [[fact:active-pilots]] active pilots de-risk near-term growth. Recommend proceeding.
